{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790420978277,"sessionID":"ses_f229a871affeZIGJyhcouaHYd6","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_f02543aa33d243198d2bdf3b","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Explore project structure","prompt":"Explore the /workspace directory thoroughly. I need to understand:\n1. The overall project structure (all files and directories)\n2. The content of any Godot scene files (.tscn)\n3. The content of any GDScript files (.gd)\n4. Any existing minimap-related code\n5. The world scene and how mobs/crates are defined\n\nReturn a comprehensive summary of all files, their paths, and their contents. Be very thorough - read every file.","subagent_type":"explore"},"output":"<task id=\"ses_f229a4768ffelpgHBkyx0KuFvK\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\nHere is a comprehensive summary of the entire `/workspace` project.\n\n---\n\n## PROJECT OVERVIEW\n\nThis is a **Godot 4.4 game project** named `minimap_demo`. It is a top-down 2D game with a player character who navigates a tile-based world, encountering mobs (enemies) and crates. The primary focus of the project is to implement a **minimap** system. The main scene is `main.tscn`, and a `task_config.json` file provides instructions for the minimap implementation that still needs to be completed.\n\n---\n\n## DIRECTORY STRUCTURE\n\n```\n/workspace/\n  .godot/                              (engine metadata/cache)\n    .gdignore\n    global_script_class_cache.cfg\n    scene_groups_cache.cfg\n    uid_cache.bin\n    editor/\n      filesystem_cache10\n      main.tscn-folding-*.cfg\n      project_metadata.cfg\n      Roboto-Medium.ttf-*.cfg\n    imported/                          (compiled texture/asset data)\n  assets/                              (26 files: 13 PNGs + 13 .import files)\n  scenes/                              (7 .tscn files)\n  scripts/                             (7 .gd files + 7 .uid files)\n  icon.svg, icon.svg.import\n  project.godot\n  task_config.json\n```\n\n---\n\n## PROJECT CONFIGURATION (`project.godot`)\n\n- **Project name:** `minimap_demo`\n- **Main scene:** `res://scenes/main.tscn`\n- **Renderer:** Forward Plus (Godot 4.4)\n- **Resolution:** 1920x1080 with `canvas_items` stretch mode\n- **Input map:** 4 actions mapped to WASD keys:\n  - `right` = D (physical keycode 68)\n  - `left` = A (physical keycode 65)\n  - `forward` = W (physical keycode 87)\n  - `back` = S (physical keycode 83)\n- **Default texture filter:** Nearest (0)\n\n---\n\n## GODOT SCRIPT CLASS DEFINITIONS\n\nFrom `.godot/global_script_class_cache.cfg`:\n- **`Crate`** extends `Area2D` (`scripts/crate.gd`)\n- **`Minimap`** extends `MarginContainer` (`scripts/minimap.gd`)\n- **`Mob`** extends `CharacterBody2D` (`scripts/mob.gd`)\n- **`Player`** extends `CharacterBody2D` (`scripts/player.gd`)\n\n---\n\n## ALL SCENE FILES (`.tscn`)\n\n### 1. `/workspace/scenes/main.tscn` (989 lines) -- THE WORLD SCENE\n\n**Load steps: 11** (2 tile textures, 1 script, 4 packed scenes)\n\n**External resources referenced:**\n- `res://assets/spritesheet_tiles copy.png` (wall tiles)\n- `res://assets/tilesheet_complete.png` (ground/decorative tiles)\n- `res://scripts/world.gd`\n- `res://scenes/minimap.tscn`\n- `res://scenes/player.tscn`\n- `res://scenes/mob.tscn`\n- `res://scenes/crate.tscn`\n\n**Node tree:**\n```\nWorld (Node2D) [script: world.gd]\n  CanvasLayer\n    Minimap (MarginContainer) [instance of minimap.tscn]\n      - custom_minimum_size = (250, 250)\n      - positioned at offset (24, 821), size ~250x250\n      - player NodePath = \"../../Player\"\n  TileMap\n    - Uses TileSet with two atlas sources (wall texture + ground texture)\n    - tile_size = 64x64\n    - Layer \"walls\" (z-index 0): tile data defines the wall boundaries\n    - Layer \"ground\" (z-index -1): tile data fills interior\n  Player (CharacterBody2D) [instance of player.tscn]\n    - position (232, 219)\n  Mobs (Node2D) [container]\n    - Mob (position 204, 580)\n    - Mob2 (position 566, 355)\n    - Mob3 (position 782, 126)\n    - Mob4 (position 1130, 983)\n  Crates (Node2D) [container]\n    - Crate (position 1809, 1125)\n    - Crate2 (position 1636, 158)\n    - Crate3 (position 1170, 152)\n    - Crate4 (position 260, 1072)\n```\n\n**Key details:**\n- The Minimap is placed on a **CanvasLayer** (renders on top of everything).\n- The Minimap's `player` node path is set to `../../Player`.\n- The TileMap has two layers: `walls` and `ground`; it defines the playable area boundary.\n- There are **4 mobs** and **4 crates** placed in the world.\n\n---\n\n### 2. `/workspace/scenes/player.tscn` (24 lines)\n\n**Type:** `CharacterBody2D` with `class_name Player`\n**Script:** `res://scripts/player.gd`\n\n**Children:**\n- `Sprite2D` -- offset (10, 0), uses `spritesheet_characters.png` with region `Rect2(265, 132, 47, 43)`\n- `CollisionShape2D` -- `CircleShape2D` with radius 20.0, offset (3, 0)\n- `Camera2D` -- rotation ~0, zoom (2, 2)\n\nThe player uses a **top-down character sprite** with a circular collision shape and a camera that follows it.\n\n---\n\n### 3. `/workspace/scenes/mob.tscn` (20 lines)\n\n**Type:** `CharacterBody2D` with `class_name Mob`\n**Groups:** `[\"minimap_objects\", \"mobs\"]`\n**Script:** `res://scripts/mob.gd`\n\n**Children:**\n- `Sprite2D` -- offset (5, 0), uses `spritesheet_characters.png` with region `Rect2(425, -1, 36, 44)` (different animation frame than player)\n- `CollisionShape2D` -- `CircleShape2D` with radius 19.0, offset (4, 0)\n\n---\n\n### 4. `/workspace/scenes/crate.tscn` (20 lines)\n\n**Type:** `Area2D` with `class_name Crate`\n**Groups:** `[\"minimap_objects\"]`\n**Script:** `res://scripts/crate.gd`\n\n**Children:**\n- `Sprite2D` -- uses `tilesheet_complete.png` with region `Rect2(1280, 256, 64, 64)` (a crate item on the tilesheet)\n- `CollisionShape2D` -- `RectangleShape2D` with size (54, 54)\n\n**Signal connection:** `body_entered` -> `_on_body_entered`\n\n---\n\n### 5. `/workspace/scenes/minimap.tscn` (53 lines)\n\n**Type:** `MarginContainer` with `class_name Minimap`\n**Script:** `res://scripts/minimap.gd`\n\n**Resources loaded:**\n- `panel_woodDetail_blank.png` -- for the 9-patch frame border\n- `pattern_blueprintPaper.png` -- for the minimap grid background\n- `minimapIcon_arrowA.png` -- player marker (arrow)\n- `minimapIcon_jewelRed.png` -- mob marker (red jewel)\n- `minimapIcon_exclamationYellow.png` -- alert/crate marker (yellow exclamation)\n\n**Node tree:**\n```\nMinimap (MarginContainer) [250x250]\n  Frame (NinePatchRect) -- wood panel border (64px patch margins)\n  Content (MarginContainer) [20px margins]\n    Grid (TextureRect) -- blue/paper background texture, stretched\n      PlayerMarker (Sprite2D) -- position (86, 86), arrow icon\n      MobMarker (Sprite2D) -- hidden, position (37, 40), red jewel icon\n      AlertMarker (Sprite2D) -- hidden, position (112, 107), yellow exclamation icon\n```\n\n**Signal connection:** `gui_input` -> `_on_gui_input`\n\nThe minimap has a decorative wood-panel frame, a blueprint-paper textured grid background, and three marker sprites for the player, mobs, and alerts/crates. The MobMarker and AlertMarker start **hidden** (visible=false).\n\n---\n\n### 6. `/workspace/scenes/heart_bar.tscn` (36 lines)\n\n**Type:** `HBoxContainer`\n**Script:** `res://scripts/heart_bar.gd`\n\n**Children:** 5 `TextureRect` nodes (named \"1\" through \"5\"), each displaying `hud_heartFull.png`\n- This is a health bar UI element (5 hearts, all full by default).\n- Minimum size: 281x45, separation: 5px.\n\n---\n\n### 7. `/workspace/scenes/size_test.tscn` (15 lines)\n\n**Type:** `MarginContainer`\n**Script:** `res://scripts/size_test.gd`\n\n**Children:** One `Control` node\n- A simple test scene that prints the Control's size after 1 second. Likely used for debugging layout sizing.\n\n---\n\n## ALL GDScript FILES (`.gd`)\n\n### 1. `/workspace/scripts/world.gd` (13 lines)\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node2D\n\n@onready var minimap = $CanvasLayer/Minimap\n\nfunc _ready():\n    get_viewport().warp_mouse(Vector2.ZERO)\n    var map_limits = $TileMap.get_used_rect()\n    $Player/Camera2D.limit_left = map_limits.position.x * $TileMap.tile_set.tile_size.x\n    $Player/Camera2D.limit_top = map_limits.position.y * $TileMap.tile_set.tile_size.y\n    $Player/Camera2D.limit_right = map_limits.end.x * $TileMap.tile_set.tile_size.x\n    $Player/Camera2D.limit_bottom = map_limits.end.y * $TileMap.tile_set.tile_size.y\n\n    for object in get_tree().get_nodes_in_group(\"minimap_objects\"):\n        object.removed.connect(minimap._on_object_removed)\n```\n\n**Function:**\n- Warps mouse to top-left on start.\n- Sets camera limits from the TileMap's used rectangle (converting tile coords to pixels using 64px tile size).\n- Iterates all nodes in the `minimap_objects` group and connects their `removed` signal to the minimap's `_on_object_removed` handler.\n\n---\n\n### 2. `/workspace/scripts/player.gd` (26 lines)\n\n```gdscript\nextends CharacterBody2D\nclass_name Player\n\nvar speed = 250\nvar rotation_speed = 2.0\nvar rotation_dir = 0\n\nfunc get_input():\n    rotation_dir = 0\n    velocity = Vector2.ZERO\n    if Input.is_action_pressed(\"right\"):\n        rotation_dir += 1\n    if Input.is_action_pressed(\"left\"):\n        rotation_dir -= 1\n    if Input.is_action_pressed(\"forward\"):\n        velocity += transform.x * speed\n    if Input.is_action_pressed(\"back\"):\n        velocity -= transform.x * speed\n\nfunc _physics_process(delta):\n    get_input()\n    rotation += rotation_dir * rotation_speed * delta\n    move_and_slide()\n```\n\n**Behavior:**\n- Top-down movement with tank-style controls: A/D rotate left/right, W/S move forward/backward along the facing direction (`transform.x`).\n- Speed: 250 units/sec, rotation: 2.0 rad/sec.\n- Uses `move_and_slide()` for physics-based movement.\n\n---\n\n### 3. `/workspace/scripts/mob.gd` (19 lines)\n\n```gdscript\nextends CharacterBody2D\nclass_name Mob\n\nsignal removed\n\nvar speed = 50\nvar minimap_icon = \"mob\"\n\nfunc _ready():\n    rotation = randf_range(0, 2*PI)\n\nfunc _physics_process(delta):\n    velocity = transform.x * speed\n    var collision = move_and_collide(velocity * delta)\n    if collision:\n        velocity = velocity.bounce(collision.get_normal()).rotated(randf_range(-PI/4, PI/4))\n    rotation = velocity.angle()\n```\n\n**Behavior:**\n- Has a `removed` signal (used by the minimap system).\n- `minimap_icon = \"mob\"` -- identifies which icon to use on the minimap.\n- Moves forward at 50 units/sec.\n- On collision with walls, bounces off with a random angle variation of +/-45 degrees, then rotates to face the new velocity direction.\n- Starts with a random rotation.\n\n---\n\n### 4. `/workspace/scripts/crate.gd` (11 lines)\n\n```gdscript\nextends Area2D\nclass_name Crate\n\nsignal removed\n\nvar minimap_icon = \"alert\"\n\nfunc _on_body_entered(body):\n    if body is Player:\n        removed.emit(self)\n        queue_free()\n```\n\n**Behavior:**\n- Has a `removed` signal (used by the minimap system).\n- `minimap_icon = \"alert\"` -- identifies which icon to use on the minimap.\n- When the player enters the crate's area, it emits `removed(self)` and frees itself.\n\n---\n\n### 5. `/workspace/scripts/minimap.gd` (34 lines) -- STUB ONLY\n\n```gdscript\nextends MarginContainer\nclass_name Minimap\n\n@export var player: Player\n@export var zoom = 1.5:\n    set = set_zoom\n\n@onready var grid = $Content/Grid\n@onready var player_marker = $Content/Grid/PlayerMarker\n@onready var mob_marker = $Content/Grid/MobMarker\n@onready var alert_marker = $Content/Grid/AlertMarker\n\n@onready var icons = {\n    \"mob\": mob_marker,\n    \"alert\": alert_marker\n}\n\nvar grid_scale\nvar markers = {}\n\nfunc _ready():\n    pass\n\nfunc _process(delta):\n    pass\n\nfunc _on_object_removed(object):\n    pass\n\nfunc set_zoom(value):\n    pass\n\nfunc _on_gui_input(event):\n    pass\n```\n\n**Current state:** The minimap script is a **stub/skeleton**. It declares all the necessary variables and node references but none of the logic is implemented yet. All methods are empty (`pass`).\n\n**What it has:**\n- `@export var player: Player` -- reference to the player (set in main.tscn via node_path)\n- `@export var zoom = 1.5` with a custom setter `set_zoom`\n- `@onready` references to `grid`, `player_marker`, `mob_marker`, `alert_marker`\n- `icons` dictionary mapping `\"mob\"` -> `mob_marker`, `\"alert\"` -> `alert_marker`\n- `grid_scale` and `markers` properties (uninitialized)\n\n**What needs implementation** (per `task_config.json`):\n- Compute `grid_scale` from grid size / viewport\n- After first frame, center the player marker\n- Duplicate and show markers for every node in `minimap_objects` group using their `minimap_icon` key\n- Store markers in the `markers` dictionary\n- Rotate markers (`player.rotation + PI/2`) and position them relative to player each frame\n- Scale markers to 0.75, clamp when off the grid\n- `_on_object_removed`: remove and erase markers\n- `_on_gui_input`: handle mouse wheel to adjust zoom\n- `set_zoom`: clamp zoom in setter\n\n---\n\n### 6. `/workspace/scripts/heart_bar.gd` (12 lines)\n\n```gdscript\nextends HBoxContainer\n\nvar heart_full = preload(\"res://assets/hud_heartFull.png\")\nvar heart_empty = preload(\"res://assets/hud_heartEmpty.png\")\n\nfunc update_health(value):\n    for i in get_child_count():\n        if value > i:\n            get_child(i).texture = heart_full\n        else:\n            get_child(i).texture = heart_empty\n```\n\n**Behavior:** Updates the health bar by iterating child `TextureRect` nodes (5 total) and setting their texture to full or empty heart based on the health value.\n\n---\n\n### 7. `/workspace/scripts/size_test.gd` (5 lines)\n\n```gdscript\nextends MarginContainer\n\nfunc _ready():\n    await get_tree().create_timer(1.0).timeout\n    printt($Control.size)\n```\n\n**Behavior:** A test utility that waits 1 second, then prints the `Control` child's size. Probably used to debug the `MarginContainer` layout sizing before building the minimap.\n\n---\n\n## MINIMAP-RELATED CODE SUMMARY\n\n### What exists today:\n\n| Component | File | Status |\n|---|---|---|\n| Minimap scene | `scenes/minimap.tscn` | **Built:** has MarginContainer with NinePatchRect frame, blueprint-paper grid, and 3 marker sprites (PlayerMarker, MobMarker, AlertMarker) |\n| Minimap script | `scripts/minimap.gd` | **Stub:** all nodes referenced, `icons` dict defined, `grid_scale` and `markers` declared, all methods empty |\n| Minimap instance in world | `main.tscn` | Placed in CanvasLayer, 250x250 size, positioned bottom-left, `player` NodePath set |\n| Mob minimap integration | `mob.gd` | Has `signal removed`, `var minimap_icon = \"mob\"`, scene has `groups=[\"minimap_objects\", \"mobs\"]` |\n| Crate minimap integration | `crate.gd` | Has `signal removed`, `var minimap_icon = \"alert\"`, scene has `groups=[\"minimap_objects\"]` |\n| World signal wiring | `world.gd` | Connects all `minimap_objects` group nodes' `removed` signals to `minimap._on_object_removed` |\n| Minimap assets | `assets/` | `minimapIcon_arrowA.png` (player), `minimapIcon_jewelRed.png` (mob), `minimapIcon_exclamationYellow.png` (alert) |\n\n### What needs to be done (from `task_config.json`):\n\nThe task instructions specify that the minimap script needs:\n1. **`set_zoom`** -- clamped zoom setter\n2. **`_ready`** -- compute `grid_scale` from grid size and viewport; after first frame, center player marker; duplicate/create markers for all `minimap_objects` group nodes using their `minimap_icon` property to look up icons; store in `markers` dict\n3. **`_process`** -- rotate markers (`player.rotation + PI/2`), position them relative to player, scale to 0.75, clamp when off-grid\n4. **`_on_object_removed`** -- remove and erase the marker for the removed object\n5. **`_on_gui_input`** -- handle mouse wheel event to adjust zoom\n6. **World scene** -- already has `minimap_objects` \"removed\" signals connected\n7. **Mob/crate** -- already have `removed` signals, `minimap_icon` property, and belong to `minimap_objects` group\n\n---\n\n## ASSETS LIST\n\nAll in `/workspace/assets/`:\n\n| Asset | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `spritesheet_characters.png` | Player and mob character sprites |\n| `spritesheet_tiles copy.png` | Wall tile sprites |\n| `tilesheet_complete.png` | Ground tiles + crate sprite |\n| `minimapIcon_arrowA.png` | Minimap player arrow marker |\n| `minimapIcon_jewelRed.png` | Minimap mob marker (red jewel) |\n| `minimapIcon_exclamationYellow.png` | Minimap alert/crate marker |\n| `panel_woodDetail_blank.png` | Minimap frame (9-patch) |\n| `pattern_blueprintPaper.png` | Minimap grid background |\n| `pattern_blueprint.png` | (alternate pattern, unused) |\n| `hud_heartFull.png` | Full heart for health bar |\n| `hud_heartEmpty.png` | Empty heart for health bar |\n| `interfacePack_sheet@2.png` | (UI sprite sheet, unused in current code) |\n| `Roboto-Medium.ttf` | Font asset |\n| `icon.svg` | Project icon |\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_f229a871affeZIGJyhcouaHYd6","sessionId":"ses_f229a4768ffelpgHBkyx0KuFvK","model":{"modelID":"deepseek-v4-pro","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Explore project structure","time":{"start":1790420826268,"end":1790420978255}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_96d5fc2e-042f-4ef4-86e8-45a0476daba4"}},"id":"prt_0dd65b88c001q4YZB4YP2n6ZpH","sessionID":"ses_f229a871affeZIGJyhcouaHYd6","messageID":"msg_0dd657ab9001db78Hs8xBbQ4fJ"}}
